[node name="Help" type="Label" parent="HUD" unique_id=38169289]
offset_left = 20.0
offset_top = 16.0
offset_right = 600.0
offset_bottom = 116.0
text = "W/S or arrows: drive   A/D: steer   Space: handbrake   R: reset car   M: zoom map   K: camera   I: show / hide this help   F: get in / out   E: start / stop engine   G: gate   P: park
On foot: W/A/S/D walk   Shift: run   Space: jump
Z / C / X: left, right, hazard signals   L: lights (park, low, high)   T: refuel at a pump (you pay as it fills)   Y: taxi fares (in a taxi)
Mouse: look around (click to grab)   Wheel: zoom (on foot: Ctrl+wheel; wheel picks the item in your hand)   E on foot: buy / use the item in your hand (drink, smoke)   C: squat on a smoke break   Esc: pause
1-5: jump into a car (testing): 1 E50   2 E55   3 Volga   4 Land Cruiser   5 Compass   =: +10 000 AMD (testing)   0: restart missions (testing)"

